","cn":"圆点","en":"Dot","desc":"选中后实心，同组互斥","desc_en":"A filled dot marks the selected option; choices in the same group are mutually exclusive"},{"key":"label","cn":"选项文案","en":"Label","desc":"说清楚选了意味着什么","desc_en":"Make the outcome of each choice clear"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"默认","en":"Default","demo":"<label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr1\" checked><i></i>支付宝</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr1\"><i></i>微信</label>","demo_en":"<label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr1\" checked><i></i>Alipay</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr1\"><i></i>WeChat</label>","when":"互斥选项不多时的标准形态","when_en":"Use for a small set of mutually exclusive options"},{"cn":"按钮样式","en":"Button","demo":"<span class=\"radio-btns\"><span class=\"rb on\">按月付</span><span class=\"rb\">按年付</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"radio-btns\"><span class=\"rb on\">Pay monthly</span><span class=\"rb\">Pay annually</span></span>","when":"选项少而短，想要更醒目好点","when_en":"For a short list that benefits from a more prominent control"},{"cn":"带说明","en":"With Desc","demo":"<div class=\"rg-col\"><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr2\" checked><i></i><span class=\"rd\">标准配送<small>免费 · 约 3 天</small></span></label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr2\"><i></i><span class=\"rd\">加急配送<small>¥8 · 明天到</small></span></label></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"rg-col\"><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr2\" checked><i></i><span class=\"rd\">Standard Shipping<small>Free · About 3 days</small></span></label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr2\"><i></i><span class=\"rd\">Expedited shipping<small>¥8 · Arriving tomorrow</small></span></label></div>","when":"选项要附带费用、时效等解释","when_en":"When each option needs supporting details, such as fees or delivery times"},{"cn":"禁用","en":"Disabled","demo":"<label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr3\" disabled><i></i>不可选</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr3\" checked disabled><i></i>已选禁用</label>","demo_en":"<label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr3\" disabled><i></i>Unavailable</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr3\" checked disabled><i></i>Checked disabled</label>","when":"某选项当前不可选但仍需展示","when_en":"When an unavailable option still needs to be shown"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>少量互斥选项</b>，直接平铺便于比较","m":"sel-radio"},{"t":"<b>隐私、可见范围</b>这类关键设置","m":"sw-three"},{"t":"选项<b>需要附带说明</b>：费用、时效写旁边","m":"radio-rich"},{"t":"<b>支付方式</b>：经典的单选场景","m":"radio-pay"}],"dont":[{"t":"选项较多且难以直接比较：使用 {c:select}","m":"radio-many","bad":true},{"t":"只有一个“<b>同意协议</b>”确认项：使用 {c:checkbox}","m":"radio-agree","bad":true},{"t":"允许<b>多选</b>：使用 {c:checkbox}","m":"radio-multi","bad":true},{"t":"需要取消选择时，增加“无”选项或改用{c:checkbox}","m":"radio-nocancel","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"预约取货时有 4 个时间段，只能选一个，并希望用户一眼看全后比较。怎样展示这些选项最合适？","options":[{"id":"radio-group","label":"并排展示一组单选项，选新项会取消旧项","feedback":"少量互斥选项适合直接展示为单选组，用户能同时比较所有时间段。","correct":true},{"id":"checkbox-group","label":"展示一组复选项，提交时再检查是否只选一个","feedback":"复选项表达可以多选，等提交时才纠错会让控件语义和真实规则冲突。","correct":false},{"id":"compact-select","label":"收进下拉选择器，每次展开后查看一个列表","feedback":"下拉可以节省空间，但题目强调少量选项要一眼看全并直接比较。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Pickup offers four time slots. People must choose one and should compare every option at a glance. What fits best?","options":[{"id":"radio-group","label":"Show a radio group where a new choice clears the previous one","feedback":"A small mutually exclusive set fits a visible radio group, letting people compare every slot.","correct":true},{"id":"checkbox-group","label":"Show checkboxes and reject multiple choices only on submit","feedback":"Checkboxes communicate multiple selection, so their meaning would conflict with the actual rule.","correct":false},{"id":"compact-select","label":"Put the slots in a dropdown that opens into a list","feedback":"A dropdown saves space, but it works against the stated need to see and compare all four options.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"把 4 个取货时间段做成一组始终可见的单选项，只允许选一个。请验证点击文字也能选择、键盘可以切换，并且选择新时段会取消旧时段。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Show the four pickup slots as one visible radio group with exactly one choice. Verify clicking labels, keyboard changes, and selecting a new slot clearing the previous one."}},"references":[{"title":"单选类型输入框","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/radio","title_en":"<input type=\"radio\">"},{"title":"单选组模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/radio/","title_en":"Radio Group Pattern"}],"scenes":["支付方式选择","性别选择","可见范围设置","配送方式"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Payment method","m":"sel-radio"},{"t":"Visibility level","m":"sw-three"},{"t":"Delivery speed","m":"radio-rich"},{"t":"Any short list with one valid answer","m":"radio-pay"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use it when several options may be selected","m":"radio-many","bad":true},{"t":"Hide a long list of choices in a crowded group","m":"radio-agree","bad":true},{"t":"Use labels that do not explain the difference","m":"radio-multi","bad":true},{"t":"Offer no way to clear the choice when “none” is valid","m":"radio-nocancel","bad":true}],"scenes":["Checkout","Privacy setting","Shipping choice","Plan selection"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px\"><b>Select payment method</b><span style=\"color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">¥ 658.00</span></div>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\" style=\"border-top:0\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-pay\" checked><i></i><span sty